{"strongs": "H0833", "word": "אָשַׁר", "translit": "a.shar", "root": "אשר", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "go straight, go on, advance", "definition": "[ אָשַׁר ] verb go straight, go on, advance (Assyrian ašâru Zim BP 11 ; Arabic, Aramaic in derivatives) — Qal Imperative אִשְׁרוּ Prov 9:6 אִשְׁרוּ בְדֶרֶךְ בִּינָה go straight on in the way of understanding . Pi`el Perfect אִשְּׁרוּ Mal 3:12 ; Gen 30:13 Imperfect תְּאַשֵּׁר Prov 4:14 + 4 t.; Imperative אַשֵּׁר Prov 23:19 Participle plural מְאַשְּׁרִים Mal 3:15 + 2 t.; — 1. intensive go straight on, advance Prov 4:14 . 2. causative lead on Prov 23:19 ; Isa 3:12 ; Isa 9:15 . 3. set right, righten Isa 1:17 . 4. pronounce happy, call blessed Gen 30:13 ( J ) Job 29:11 ; Ps 72:17 ; Prov 31:28 ; Song 6:9 ; Mal 3:12 ; Mal 3:15 . Pu`al Imperfect יְאֻשַּׁר Ps 41:3 Participle מְאֻשָּׁר Prov 3:18 ; Isa 9:15 . 1. be led on Isa 9:15 . 2. be made happy, blessed Ps 41:3 ; Prov 3:18 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB834')\">BDB834</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H833')\">H833</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB833')\">BDB833</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB835')\">BDB835</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>אָשַׁר</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>go straight, go on, advance</highlightword> (Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>ašâru</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Zim')\">Zim<sup>BP 11</sup></lookup>; Arabic, Aramaic in derivatives) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>אִשְׁרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 9:6\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(20,9,6)\">Prov 9:6</ref> <bdbheb>אִשְׁרוּ בְדֶרֶךְ בִּינָה</bdbheb> <highlight>go straight on in the way of understanding</highlight>. <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>אִשְּׁרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mal 3:12\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,12)\">Mal 3:12</re